msgid "**Glucose monitoring with PLS**"
msgstr "PLSによるグルコースモニタリング"

#: ../../source/learn/pls_regression.ipynb:20
msgid ""
"💡\\ **NOTE:** This document is a Jupyter notebook. You can download the "
